00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.680
to respond to that PSet.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.470
More on how we
evaluate in this class

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:35.050
in a different recording--

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.430
just to say here
